```console
$ scherzo-cloud delegation --help
Manage Scherzo Cloud delegations

Usage: scherzo-cloud delegation [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list     List your delegation history
  propose  Propose delegation to a service principal
  show     Show a delegation
  accept   Accept a delegation as its service principal
  end      End a delegation
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
